    "created_at": "2016-07-19T17:28:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-19T17:28:26Z",
    "body": "I would put zero faith in defaultView behavior matching the behavior of other algorithms that depend on whether a document has browsing context.  It's worth going through and checking all of them in browsers before adding normative requirements around this stuff.  It's quite possible that browsers really do do this, and it's also quite possible they do something else and the web depends on them doing that....\n",
