    "updated_at": "2016-07-19T17:34:26Z",
    "body": "Right, I also tested location and stylesheet loading. I just tested image loading and script execution as well: http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=4339 (console and network panel remain empty for me)\n\nThis isn't completely comprehensive, but it's pretty close. It seems like at least a strict improvement over the current spec which says that all of those things should work.\n",
